                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "As for BERT-based models, we used the implementation in Transformers $ ^{17} $ (Wolf et al., 2020). We used the whole-word-masking model with a batch size of 32, a dropout rate of 0.1, a learning rate of 2e-5, and Adam (Kingma and Ba, 2015) for optimization. The training stopped after 3 epochs without improvement in the validation loss.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                1079,
                584,
                1265
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
