                    1349.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• w/ Pc: Feature extraction is performed with  $ h_c = [u; v] W^c $ in consideration of personality. Here, v is a 768-dimensional text representation obtained from the [CLS] token of BERT, and u is a representation of the Big Five personality indicators given by linearly transforming the five indicator values into a 768-dimensional vector. When estimating the emotional intensity,  $ h_c $ is used instead of h.",
